# Production build config for the frontend.
#
# Copy this file to `.env.production` (same directory). Vite loads
# `.env.production` automatically for `npm run build` / `vite build` and it
# overrides `.env`, so the same codebase builds correctly for local dev
# (`.env` -> localhost) and production (`.env.production` -> real API) with no
# code changes.
#
# `.env.production` is NOT gitignored — it holds only the public API URL, no
# secrets — so you may commit it once the domain is final, or keep it local.

# The real, HTTPS production API origin. Must be HTTPS (the site is served
# over HTTPS via CloudFront; browsers block an HTTPS page calling a plain
# HTTP API). No trailing slash.
VITE_API_BASE=https://api.autostrat.net
